[issue by anderspike]
IronFurnaces Version: 26.1-1.0.0
NeoForge Version: 26.1.36

Every time auto output is enabled, the game instantly crashes when the furnace tries to output something. Doesn't matter the slot used to output, or what type of container it is outputting into (tested both barrel and chest). I was able to replicate the bug consistently on a brand new world with ONLY iron furnaces and Neoforge installed. Every other feature of Iron Furnaces (including auto input) seems to work fine. I didn't test every type of furnace, but at the very least, iron, emerald, and obsidian all caused the crash.

